  <History Date="12-05-26" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Created (inconsistencies between modes look strange.  charts contain duplicate channel offsets.  macros require channel 2 at full which cannot be set independently from channel 1 as it is the LSB of a 16bit control.  defined with both set to full)" Version="0" />
